BT /F1 15.0 Tf 54.0 748.0 Td (InkWell Architecture Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 728.0 Td (InkWell is a Spring Boot microservices platform for a blogging and publishing product.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 717.0 Td (The backend is organized as independent Maven modules that register with Eureka, route) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 706.0 Td (public traffic through Spring Cloud Gateway, expose actuator endpoints to Spring Boot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 695.0 Td (Admin, and use MySQL-backed persistence where a service owns state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 684.0 Td (Implemented Services) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 668.0 Td (- discovery-service: port 8761; Eureka registry used by every runtime service for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 657.5 Td (  service discovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 647.0 Td (- admin-server: port 9090; Spring Boot Admin dashboard for health, metrics, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 636.5 Td (  operational monitoring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 626.0 Td (- api-gateway: port 8080; Public backend entry point, route dispatcher, JWT validator,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 615.5 Td (  and gateway policy layer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 605.0 Td (- auth-service: port 8081; Identity, authentication, user profile, author request,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 594.5 Td (  feedback, OTP, email, and subscription payment state boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 584.0 Td (- user-service: logical domain only in this repository. No standalone user-service) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 573.5 Td (  module exists in this repository. User identity, profile, role, OAuth2, refresh-token,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 563.0 Td (  and internal user lookup behavior are implemented inside auth-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 552.5 Td (- post-service: port 8082; Post authoring, publishing, public feed, likes, bookmarks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 542.0 Td (  follows, and reading history.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 531.5 Td (- comment-service: port 8084; Threaded comments, replies, comment likes, and comment) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 521.0 Td (  cleanup on deleted posts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 510.5 Td (- category-service: port 8083; Canonical category and tag taxonomy management.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 500.0 Td (- media-service: port 8085; Media upload, metadata persistence, and local/S3 storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 489.5 Td (  abstraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 479.0 Td (- newsletter-service: port 8086; Newsletter subscriptions, confirmations, campaign) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 468.5 Td (  records, templates, and campaign delivery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 458.0 Td (- notification-service: port 8087; In-app notifications, broadcasts, audit logs, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 447.5 Td (  optional notification emails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 437.0 Td (- payment-service: port 8088; Small Razorpay adapter for order creation and signature) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 426.5 Td (  verification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 416.0 Td (- subscription-service: logical domain only in this repository. No standalone) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 405.5 Td (  subscription-service module exists in this repository. Subscription tier/status and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 395.0 Td (  Razorpay-backed subscription payment state are implemented mainly inside auth-service,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 384.5 Td (  with payment-service acting as a smaller Razorpay utility boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 374.0 Td (Design Patterns Used) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 358.0 Td (- API Gateway Pattern: api-gateway centralizes public routing, CORS, rate limiting, JWT) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 347.5 Td (  validation, and identity header propagation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 337.0 Td (- Service Discovery Pattern: discovery-service provides Eureka registration and lookup) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 326.5 Td (  so services use logical names like lb://auth-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 316.0 Td (- Layered Architecture: controllers receive HTTP input, services own business rules,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 305.5 Td (  repositories own persistence, and DTOs define API contracts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 295.0 Td (- DTO Pattern: request/response records decouple public payloads from JPA entities and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 284.5 Td (  place validation at the API boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 274.0 Td (- Repository Pattern: Spring Data repositories hide SQL/JPA access behind interfaces.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 263.5 Td (- Event-driven Communication: RabbitMQ routes post, comment, reply, broadcast, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 253.0 Td (  cleanup events across services.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 242.5 Td (- Circuit Breaker Pattern: post-service configures Resilience4j for category-service) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 232.0 Td (  calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 221.5 Td (- Adapter Pattern: media storage and Razorpay/mail integrations are wrapped behind) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 211.0 Td (  service classes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 200.5 Td (Overall Platform Communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 66.0 184.5 Td (    flowchart LR) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 66.0 175.5 Td (        Client[React frontend or API client] --> Gateway[api-gateway]) Tj ET
endstream
