BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 487.0 Td (End-to-End Request Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 471.0 Td (- Client sends HTTP request to api-gateway on port 8080.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 460.5 Td (- Gateway route predicates match the path and choose the target service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 450.0 Td (- For protected routes, JwtAuthenticationFilter validates the bearer token and forwards) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 439.5 Td (  identity headers such as user id, username, email, role, subscription tier, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 429.0 Td (  subscription status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 418.5 Td (- Downstream GatewayAuthenticationFilter converts those headers into) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 408.0 Td (  GatewayUserPrincipal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 397.5 Td (- Controller validates request DTOs and delegates to the service layer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 387.0 Td (- Service layer applies business rules and calls repositories, Feign clients,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 376.5 Td (  mail/payment adapters, or RabbitMQ.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 366.0 Td (- Repository layer persists or reads service-owned database records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 355.5 Td (- GlobalExceptionHandler converts validation and domain exceptions into consistent API) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 345.0 Td (  errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 334.5 Td (- Actuator exposes health/metrics to admin-server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 324.0 Td (Core User Flows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 54.0 308.0 Td (Login/signup flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 295.0 Td (AuthController receives register/login. AuthService validates uniqueness and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 284.0 Td (credentials, PasswordEncoder hashes passwords, JwtService issues access token,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 273.0 Td (RefreshTokenService stores refresh tokens, and ApiResponse returns AuthResponse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 54.0 262.0 Td (Post creation flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 249.0 Td (Author calls api-gateway /api/posts/author. Gateway validates JWT and role context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 238.0 Td (PostService sanitizes content, saves Post, syncs taxonomy through CategoryClient, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 227.0 Td (publishes post.published when published.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 54.0 216.0 Td (Comment flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 203.0 Td (Reader calls comment-service. CommentService validates the post through PostClient,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 192.0 Td (sanitizes content, saves Comment, and publishes comment.created or comment.reply for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 181.0 Td (notification-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 54.0 170.0 Td (Subscription/payment flow) Tj ET
