BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 712.0 Td (Identity, authentication, user profile, author request, feedback, OTP, email, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 701.0 Td (subscription payment state boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 690.0 Td (- Default port: 8081.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 679.5 Td (- Database or persistence: MySQL auth_db plus Redis for rate limiting/temporary data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 669.0 Td (- External integrations: Email SMTP, OAuth2 providers, Razorpay API, Eureka, Admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 658.5 Td (  Server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 648.0 Td (Request and Internal Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 632.0 Td (Controllers validate DTOs, services apply business rules, repositories persist) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 621.0 Td (users/tokens/requests/payments, and mappers shape API responses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 610.0 Td (- Controller layer: accepts HTTP input, validates DTOs, resolves the principal where) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 599.5 Td (  needed, and returns ApiResponse or ResponseEntity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 589.0 Td (- Service layer: owns business rules, authorization decisions, mapping, transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 578.5 Td (  event publishing, and remote client calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 568.0 Td (- Repository layer: persists service-owned state through Spring Data JPA where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 557.5 Td (  service has a database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 547.0 Td (- Exception flow: domain exceptions and validation failures are converted by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 536.5 Td (  GlobalExceptionHandler where present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 526.0 Td (- Authentication/authorization: Issues access and refresh JWTs. Gateway-authenticated) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 515.5 Td (  internal calls pass identity headers that GatewayAuthenticationFilter converts into a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 505.0 Td (  principal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 494.5 Td (Inter-Service Communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 478.5 Td (- API Gateway: public traffic is routed to this service through api-gateway route) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 468.0 Td (  predicates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 457.5 Td (- Eureka: the service registers using spring.application.name so callers can use lb://) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 447.0 Td (  names or Feign client names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 436.5 Td (- JWT propagation: api-gateway validates tokens and forwards identity headers consumed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 426.0 Td (  by GatewayAuthenticationFilter when present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 415.5 Td (- Admin monitoring: actuator endpoints are registered with admin-server for health and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 405.0 Td (  metrics.) Tj ET
