BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 632.0 Td (sanitizes content, persists comments/likes, and publishes notification events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 621.0 Td (- Controller layer: accepts HTTP input, validates DTOs, resolves the principal where) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 610.5 Td (  needed, and returns ApiResponse or ResponseEntity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 600.0 Td (- Service layer: owns business rules, authorization decisions, mapping, transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 589.5 Td (  event publishing, and remote client calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 579.0 Td (- Repository layer: persists service-owned state through Spring Data JPA where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 568.5 Td (  service has a database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 558.0 Td (- Exception flow: domain exceptions and validation failures are converted by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 547.5 Td (  GlobalExceptionHandler where present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 537.0 Td (- Authentication/authorization: GatewayAuthenticationFilter trusts identity headers from) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 526.5 Td (  api-gateway and makes a GatewayUserPrincipal available to controllers/services.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 516.0 Td (Inter-Service Communication) Tj ET
