BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 468.5 Td (  names or Feign client names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 458.0 Td (- JWT propagation: api-gateway validates tokens and forwards identity headers consumed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 447.5 Td (  by GatewayAuthenticationFilter when present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 437.0 Td (- Admin monitoring: actuator endpoints are registered with admin-server for health and) Tj ET
