BT /F1 15.0 Tf 54.0 748.0 Td (media-service) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 728.0 Td (Service Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 712.0 Td (Media upload, metadata persistence, and local/S3 storage abstraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 701.0 Td (- Default port: 8085.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 690.5 Td (- Database or persistence: MySQL media_db plus local filesystem or S3 object storage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 680.0 Td (- External integrations: Local disk or AWS S3, Eureka, Admin Server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 669.5 Td (Request and Internal Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 653.5 Td (MediaController receives multipart uploads, MediaService validates and stores files) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 642.5 Td (through StorageService, then MediaRepository stores metadata.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 631.5 Td (- Controller layer: accepts HTTP input, validates DTOs, resolves the principal where) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 621.0 Td (  needed, and returns ApiResponse or ResponseEntity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 610.5 Td (- Service layer: owns business rules, authorization decisions, mapping, transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 600.0 Td (  event publishing, and remote client calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 589.5 Td (- Repository layer: persists service-owned state through Spring Data JPA where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 579.0 Td (  service has a database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 568.5 Td (- Exception flow: domain exceptions and validation failures are converted by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 558.0 Td (  GlobalExceptionHandler where present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 547.5 Td (- Authentication/authorization: Gateway-authenticated uploads use GatewayUserPrincipal;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 537.0 Td (  public file URLs can be served for read access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 526.5 Td (Inter-Service Communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 510.5 Td (- API Gateway: public traffic is routed to this service through api-gateway route) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 500.0 Td (  predicates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 489.5 Td (- Eureka: the service registers using spring.application.name so callers can use lb://) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 479.0 Td (  names or Feign client names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 468.5 Td (- JWT propagation: api-gateway validates tokens and forwards identity headers consumed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 458.0 Td (  by GatewayAuthenticationFilter when present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 447.5 Td (- Admin monitoring: actuator endpoints are registered with admin-server for health and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 437.0 Td (  metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 426.5 Td (- Communication peer: api-gateway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 416.0 Td (- Communication peer: post-service/frontend consumers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 405.5 Td (File-by-File Explanation) Tj ET
