BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 365.5 Td (versions, runtime dependencies, and test dependencies. It is needed so Maven can build) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 354.5 Td (this service consistently as part of the multi-module platform.) Tj ET
