BT /F1 15.0 Tf 54.0 748.0 Td (payment-service) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 728.0 Td (Service Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 712.0 Td (Small Razorpay adapter for order creation and signature verification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 701.0 Td (- Default port: 8088.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 690.5 Td (- Database or persistence: None in current module.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 680.0 Td (- External integrations: Razorpay SDK/API, Eureka, Admin Server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 669.5 Td (Request and Internal Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 653.5 Td (PaymentController delegates to RazorpayService to create orders and verify signatures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 642.5 Td (- Controller layer: accepts HTTP input, validates DTOs, resolves the principal where) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 632.0 Td (  needed, and returns ApiResponse or ResponseEntity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 621.5 Td (- Service layer: owns business rules, authorization decisions, mapping, transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 611.0 Td (  event publishing, and remote client calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 600.5 Td (- Repository layer: persists service-owned state through Spring Data JPA where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 590.0 Td (  service has a database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 579.5 Td (- Exception flow: domain exceptions and validation failures are converted by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 569.0 Td (  GlobalExceptionHandler where present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 558.5 Td (- Authentication/authorization: Routed through api-gateway; subscription state is stored) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 548.0 Td (  in auth-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 54.0 537.5 Td (Inter-Service Communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 521.5 Td (- API Gateway: public traffic is routed to this service through api-gateway route) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 511.0 Td (  predicates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 500.5 Td (- Eureka: the service registers using spring.application.name so callers can use lb://) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 490.0 Td (  names or Feign client names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 479.5 Td (- JWT propagation: api-gateway validates tokens and forwards identity headers consumed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 469.0 Td (  by GatewayAuthenticationFilter when present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 458.5 Td (- Admin monitoring: actuator endpoints are registered with admin-server for health and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 448.0 Td (  metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 437.5 Td (- Communication peer: api-gateway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 427.0 Td (- Communication peer: auth-service logical subscription flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 72.0 416.5 Td (- Communication peer: Razorpay.) Tj ET
