BT /F1 15.0 Tf 54.0 748.0 Td (Final Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 728.0 Td (InkWell follows a layered microservice architecture with api-gateway as the edge,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 717.0 Td (discovery-service as the service registry, admin-server as the monitoring console, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 706.0 Td (independently persisted domain services. Authentication and user/subscription state) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 695.0 Td (currently live in auth-service; post, comment, category, media, newsletter,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 684.0 Td (notification, and payment concerns are split into dedicated modules. RabbitMQ provides) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 673.0 Td (asynchronous event flow, Feign provides typed synchronous service calls, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 662.0 Td (actuator/Eureka/Admin Server provide runtime observability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 651.0 Td (The added package-info.java files document service package boundaries without changing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 640.0 Td (business logic. This PDF and its Markdown source provide the full beginner-friendly) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 54.0 629.0 Td (but technically detailed reference for maintainers.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
